    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29489" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Mŏlo</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Mŏlon</span></b> , ōnis,
